--- !u!114 &889003250
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 889003248}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7723780579e36cc42bbd4fa157cf0517, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1655368762}
  nameText: {fileID: 1157510290}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 904743457}
  nextButton: {fileID: 2103057782}
  playerController: {fileID: 8883790674275804887}
  dialogueLines:
  - speaker: Elder
    text: "Sir Knight... thank the Heavens you\u2019ve arrived.\nThe village of Oakhaven
      is running out of time."
  - speaker: Knight
    text: What threatens this land, elder?
  - speaker: Edler
    text: 'Malakor, our former court mage.

      As age began to wither his body,

      a
      desperate terror took hold of him.'
  - speaker: Elder
    text: 'He became obsessed with escaping death

      and achieving absolute immortality.'
  - speaker: Knight
    text: 'Fear of death makes men do foolish things.

      But how does his pursuit
      endanger the village?'
  - speaker: Elder
    text: 'He found a banned ritual that fuels his eternal life,

      but it requires
      a massive living conduit.'
  - speaker: Elder
    text: Right now, he is siphoning the life force directly from our lands.
  - speaker: Elder
    text: 'Our crops are dying, livestock are collapsing,

      and now... our villagers
      are aging rapidly overnight.'
  - speaker: Knight
    text: He's stealing their youth to preserve his own.
  - speaker: Elder
    text: 'Precisely.

      He doesn''t act out of pure hatred,

      but his terror
      of the grave has stripped him of his humanity.'
  - speaker: Elder
    text: He won't stop until every soul in this valley is drained dry.
  - speaker: Knight
    text: 'I will track him down to his ritual''s place

      and cut his tether
      to life.'
  - speaker: Elder
    text: "May the Light protect you, Knight.\nSeek him through the Whispering Woods.\nBe
      swift\u2014with every hour that passes,\nhe grows stronger while our people
      fade."
